粧品事業を軸に、オリーブと小豆島の可能性を追求しています。</p></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1622701374491" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1622701374491"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p><u><a href="https://shl-olive.co.jp/" class="" aria-describedby="a11y-external-message">公式Webサイトを見る</a></u></p></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1622701374581" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1622701374581"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>#オリーブ　#小豆島　#地域貢献</p></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" id="r-1625123850316" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1625123850316"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1625123850253" data-id="1625123850253"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" id="e-1625123853539" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1625123853539"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1><strong>カポックノットは、ブランド独自の基準として「サステナブルアクション」を導入し、</strong><strong style="letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">日々の活動の見直しや改善を行なっています。</strong></h1></div></div><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" id="e-1625123860233" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1625123860233" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/8a2115a0-7e3d-428b-9171-819e482bcae5/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/KK_picture.jpg" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" da